<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 18:20:13 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>驾驶执照的终结：Uber 高管称汽车所有权是“效率最低的资产”，并表示 15 到 20 年内没有人需要汽车</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/uber-president-coo-andrew-macdonald-future-with-autonomous-vehicles-no-car-ownership-or-drivers-licenses-career-success/</link><description>Uber 总裁兼首席运营官安德鲁·麦克唐纳 (Andrew Macdonald) 预测，二十年后，大多数人将骑自行车、踏板车、公共交通或自动驾驶汽车出行。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2277840130-e1788189250995.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 15:38:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/uber-president-coo-andrew-macdonald-future-with-autonomous-vehicles-no-car-ownership-or-drivers-licenses-career-success/</guid></item><item><title>塔吉特的失误疏远了消费者并动摇了投资者。执行主席布莱恩康奈尔应该辞职</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/target-brian-cornell-misteps/</link><description>塔吉特的年会结果应该向董事会发出一个明确的信息，即投资者渴望新的领导层来帮助公司收复失地。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Tejal_Profile_Pic_2880x2880.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/target-brian-cornell-misteps/</guid></item><item><title>霍尔木兹海峡危机威胁亚洲石油和天然气生命线。以下是该地区如何重写其能源策略</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/iran-war-hormuz-blocked-asia-energy-crisis-oil-gas/</link><description>“尽管过去十年替代和绿色技术兴起，但全球经济仍然非常依赖石油和天然气。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2282682906.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/iran-war-hormuz-blocked-asia-energy-crisis-oil-gas/</guid></item><item><title>一名 NFL 球员努力重返校园，大学体育和“业余”成为新的“职业”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/college-amateur-sports-professional-nfl-return/</link><description>职业选手回归业余运动？据一位体育历史学家称，这首先就不是业余的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2254801259-e1787937423622.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/college-amateur-sports-professional-nfl-return/</guid></item><item><title>雷·达里奥 (Ray Dalio) 在职业生涯早期就破产了，他不得不向父亲借了 4,000 美元，并吸取了 2 条教训，使他走上了亿万富翁之路</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/ray-dalio-borrow-4000-dad-lessons-becoming-billionaire-humility-diversification/</link><description>“没有人能把每件事都做到完美，即使是沃伦·巴菲特，”戴利奥在第 92 街 Y 的谈话中告诉大卫·鲁宾斯坦。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/GettyImages-2216117976-e1755108437142.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:43:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/ray-dalio-borrow-4000-dad-lessons-becoming-billionaire-humility-diversification/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗总统承认“我们有很多问题”，导弹“毫无用处”，因为美国扼杀了伊朗经济，同时削弱了德黑兰对霍尔木兹海峡的控制</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/iran-economy-many-problems-inflation-naval-blockade-hormuz-oil-exports-fuel-imports/</link><description>“现在人们都处于边缘；如果我给他们施加更大的压力，他们可能会从边缘掉下来。我们必须小心，不要有人掉下来。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9883353-e1788125503144.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 23:10:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/iran-economy-many-problems-inflation-naval-blockade-hormuz-oil-exports-fuel-imports/</guid></item><item><title>阿联酋在其水域拦截伊朗无人机，伊朗战争“危险升级”，并威胁“对侵略者做出果断回应”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/uae-iranian-drone-war/</link><description>特朗普上周强调，他“并不急于”让伊朗重返谈判桌。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26243261413105-e1788186132478.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:38:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/uae-iranian-drone-war/</guid></item><item><title>8 月份，天然气价格首次突破每日 4 美元。美国对伊朗的新打击导致油价再次走高</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/gas-prices-oil-us-iran-strikes-strait-hormuz/</link><description>美军在全球石油运输的主要航线霍尔木兹海峡附近袭击伊朗火箭发射器后，布伦特原油价格上涨逾 3%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26239535605846-e1788185903782.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:38:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/gas-prices-oil-us-iran-strikes-strait-hormuz/</guid></item><item><title>日产和本田签署协议，通过汽车软件“更快的开发周期”提高竞争力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/nissan-honda-software-deal/</link><description>根据协议，总部位于港口城市横滨的日产汽车和总部位于东京的本田汽车将共享“核心 ECU”中的标准化零件以及软件。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26243337505584-e1788186835947.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:37:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/nissan-honda-software-deal/</guid></item><item><title>我们生活在“G 型经济”中——婴儿潮一代控制着 90 万亿美元，而其他人都在等待</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/baby-boomer-economy-generational-net-worth-gen-z-millennials-stock-real-estate-wealth/</link><description>“财富集中在老一辈手中，这表明消费支出越来越多地由积累的退休财富而不是劳动收入的支出来支撑。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290499331-e1788184009584.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:24:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/baby-boomer-economy-generational-net-worth-gen-z-millennials-stock-real-estate-wealth/</guid></item></channel></rss>